WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:16.510
Dr. Odd's robot charged toward Roxy.

2
00:00:16.511 --> 00:00:19.342
She jumped out of the way.

3
00:00:19.343 --> 00:00:22.126
The robot poked a bubble floating nearby.

4
00:00:22.127 --> 00:00:24.574
Pop! A car fell out.

5
00:00:24.575 --> 00:00:29.610
"Aah!" the driver cried as the car fell toward the street.

6
00:00:29.611 --> 00:00:32.980
"Ha-ha!" Dr. Odd laughed.

7
00:00:32.981 --> 00:00:37.685
Zoom! Roxy shot toward the car and caught it.

8
00:00:37.686 --> 00:00:40.701
Then—pop, pop, pop!

9
00:00:40.702 --> 00:00:45.733
"Help! Rocket Girl!" shouted several voices.

10
00:00:45.734 --> 00:00:47.539
Roxy looked up.

11
00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:51.781
The robot was popping more bubbles, and more cars were falling.

12
00:00:51.782 --> 00:00:56.799
"Now you'll be too busy to stop me!" Dr. Odd laughed.

13
00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:02.807
Roxy flew fast, catching each car before it hit the street.

14
00:01:02.808 --> 00:01:05.988
Soon all the cars were safe on the ground.

15
00:01:05.989 --> 00:01:09.743
They were all covered with blue sticky goo from the bubbles.

16
00:01:09.744 --> 00:01:13.433
Meanwhile the robot aimed its arm at Metro City Bank.

17
00:01:13.434 --> 00:01:17.547
Roxy flew fast and yanked its arm.

18
00:01:17.548 --> 00:01:21.325
She pointed it at the sky just as it sprayed more mist.

19
00:01:21.326 --> 00:01:25.771
"You won't stop me, Rocket Girl!" Dr. Odd shouted.

20
00:01:25.772 --> 00:01:29.146
Roxy flew down as Dr. Odd continued to yell.

21
00:01:29.147 --> 00:01:32.277
"I got rid of Police Headquarters!

22
00:01:32.278 --> 00:01:35.009
I got rid of Mayor Bloom!

23
00:01:35.010 --> 00:01:38.992
And now I will get rid of—Aah!"

24
00:01:38.993 --> 00:01:42.157
With one kick Roxy knocked the robot over.

25
00:01:42.158 --> 00:01:46.384
It fell down with a loud crash.

26
00:01:46.385 --> 00:01:50.745
Skrunch! Roxy stomped the robot with both feet.

27
00:01:50.746 --> 00:01:52.920
The metal bent and twisted.

28
00:01:52.921 --> 00:01:55.053
Sparks flew everywhere.

29
00:01:55.054 --> 00:01:58.690
One last puff of blue mist rose from the robot's arm.

30
00:01:58.691 --> 00:02:01.585
The small cloud hung in the air.

31
00:02:01.586 --> 00:02:04.289
Roxy heard a hatch open.

32
00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:11.006
Dr. Odd crawled out and started to run.

33
00:02:11.007 --> 00:02:16.571
"Hey, Dr. Odd!" Roxy yelled. "You forgot something!"

34
00:02:16.572 --> 00:02:18.777
Roxy took a deep breath.

35
00:02:18.778 --> 00:02:23.528
She blew with all her power. Whoo-ooo-oosh!

36
00:02:23.529 --> 00:02:28.403
The cloud of blue mist raced after Dr. Odd until—bloop!

37
00:02:28.404 --> 00:02:32.720
"Argh!" Dr. Odd yelled from inside the bubble.

38
00:02:32.721 --> 00:02:35.817
Roxy ripped off the robot's hand and smiled.

39
00:02:35.818 --> 00:02:38.754
"You wait here, Dr. Odd," she said.

40
00:02:38.755 --> 00:02:46.211
"I'm going to pop some bubbles."

41
00:02:46.212 --> 00:02:50.046
Jack, Terrell, and Mara were sitting in the empty parking lot.

42
00:02:50.047 --> 00:02:53.660
"I wish we had some customers," said Jack.

43
00:02:53.661 --> 00:02:58.218
"I wonder what's taking Roxy so long," said Terrell.

44
00:02:58.219 --> 00:03:02.161
Mara heard something. "Look!"

45
00:03:02.162 --> 00:03:05.815
A long line of cars pulled into the parking lot.

46
00:03:05.816 --> 00:03:09.472
They were all covered in blue sticky goo.

47
00:03:09.473 --> 00:03:14.684
"We need our cars washed!" said one driver.

48
00:03:14.685 --> 00:03:17.819
The kids got right to work.

49
00:03:17.820 --> 00:03:21.172
A moment later Roxy returned.

50
00:03:21.173 --> 00:03:25.154
"Thanks for putting up more signs, Roxy!" said Jack.

51
00:03:25.155 --> 00:03:27.503
"Yeah," said Terrell.

52
00:03:27.504 --> 00:03:30.744
"Where did you get the signs anyway?"

53
00:03:30.745 --> 00:03:35.892
Roxy didn't answer.

54
00:03:35.893 --> 00:03:43.898
She just squeezed out a sponge and started washing cars.
